# Google sign-in (files/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md §6.1). Safe to expose in the
# frontend bundle — it's a public client ID, not a secret (the OAuth client's
# secret lives only in backend/.env, and isn't even used by this project's
# ID-token flow — see backend/src/config/googleAuth.ts).
# From the same OAuth client at console.cloud.google.com as backend/.env's
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID — this must be the exact same value.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=""
